&lt;p style="margin-left: 96px; line-height: 18px; margin-right: 0px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;(1）営業収益&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 108px; line-height: 18px; margin-right: 0px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 12px"&gt;本邦以外の外部顧客への営業収益がないため、記載を省略しております。&lt;/p&gt;
</jpcrp_cor:RevenuesFromExternalCustomersInformationForEachRegionTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:PropertyPlantAndEquipmentInformationForEachRegionTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration_NonConsolidatedMember">
&lt;p style="margin-left: 96px; line-height: 18px; margin-right: 0px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;(2）有形固定資産&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 108px; line-height: 18px; margin-right: 0px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 12px"&gt;本邦以外に所在している有形固定資産がないため、記載を省略しております。&lt;/p&gt;
</jpcrp_cor:PropertyPlantAndEquipmentInformationForEachRegionTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:InformationForEachOfMainCustomersTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration_NonConsolidatedMember">
